Output docs/demo/top.gif
Require kubectl
Set Height 640
Source docs/demo/setup.tape

Type "kubectl flink top -A" Sleep 400ms Enter
Sleep 3s
# The unhealthy only, then the worst one's verdict, collected while the cursor rested on it.
Type "f" Sleep 1.5s
Enter Sleep 4s
Down@250ms 10 Sleep 1s
Escape Sleep 800ms
# A job by name, and its job graph.
Escape Sleep 300ms
Type "/settlement" Sleep 600ms Enter Sleep 800ms
Enter Sleep 3s
Type "2" Sleep 4s
Escape Sleep 500ms
Type "q" Sleep 500ms
